<hr>

<h2>4. FUNCTIONAL SPECIFICATION</h2>
<h3>4.1 Core Features</h3>
<p><b>4.1.1 Student Management</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Add Student: Manual entry with fields for name, attendance %, midterm 1 (0-20), midterm 2 (0-20), and previous grade</li>
<li>Edit Student: Update existing records</li>
<li>Delete Student: Remove individual or all student records</li>
<li>Bulk Import: CSV file upload with automatic parsing</li>
</ul>

<p><b>4.1.2 Performance Prediction</b></p>
<p>The system uses a weighted algorithm to predict final grades:</p>
<table>
<tr><th>Factor</th><th>Weight</th></tr>
<tr><td>Attendance</td><td>20%</td></tr>
<tr><td>Midterm 1</td><td>25%</td></tr>
<tr><td>Midterm 2</td><td>35%</td></tr>
<tr><td>Previous Grade</td><td>20%</td></tr>
</table>

<p><b>Decision Tree Classification:</b></p>
<p>A student is classified as "At Risk" if ANY of the following conditions are met:</p>
<ol>
<li>Predicted grade < 60%</li>
<li>Attendance < 75%</li>
<li>Midterm 2 score dropped > 15 points from Midterm 1</li>
</ol>

<p><b>4.1.3 Data Visualization</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Bar chart showing midterm scores for all students</li>
<li>Color-coded risk indicators (Amber = At Risk, Indigo = Safe)</li>
<li>Real-time statistics dashboard</li>
</ul>
<div class="box">[SCREENSHOT SPACE 2: Analytics Charts Section]</div>

<h3>4.2 API Endpoints</h3>
<table>
<tr><th>Method</th><th>Endpoint</th><th>Description</th></tr>
<tr><td>GET</td><td>/api/students</td><td>Fetch all students</td></tr>
<tr><td>POST</td><td>/api/students</td><td>Add new student</td></tr>
<tr><td>POST</td><td>/api/students/bulk</td><td>Bulk import students</td></tr>
<tr><td>PUT</td><td>/api/students/:id</td><td>Update student prediction</td></tr>
<tr><td>PUT</td><td>/api/students/bulk</td><td>Bulk update predictions</td></tr>
<tr><td>DELETE</td><td>/api/students</td><td>Delete all students</td></tr>
<tr><td>DELETE</td><td>/api/students/:id</td><td>Delete single student</td></tr>
</table>

