<h2>9. DEPLOYMENT INSTRUCTIONS</h2>
<h3>9.1 Prerequisites</h3>
<ul>
<li>Node.js (Latest version recommended)</li>
<li>npm or yarn</li>
</ul>

<h3>9.2 Installation Steps</h3>
<p><b>1. Navigate to project directory:</b></p>
<p>cd "D:\workie\Mansi's Projects\spps final\spps final"</p>

<p><b>2. Install dependencies:</b></p>
<p>npm install</p>

<p><b>3. Configure API Key (optional):</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Create .env.local file</li>
<li>Add: GEMINI_API_KEY=your_api_key</li>
</ul>

<p><b>4. Run the application:</b></p>
<p>npm run dev</p>

<p><b>5. Access the application:</b></p>
<p>Open browser to: http://localhost:3001</p>

<h3>9.3 Build for Production</h3>
<p>npm run build</p>
<p>The built files will be in the dist/ folder.</p>

