<h2>10. LIMITATIONS & FUTURE ENHANCEMENTS</h2>
<h3>10.1 Current Limitations</h3>
<ul>
<li>Prediction model is a simplified linear approximation (not actual ML)</li>
<li>Single-user interface (no authentication)</li>
<li>Local SQLite database (not cloud-based)</li>
<li>No data backup mechanism</li>
</ul>

<h3>10.2 Future Enhancements</h3>
<ul>
<li>[ ] Integrate actual Google Gemini AI for more accurate predictions</li>
<li>[ ] Add user authentication and role-based access</li>
<li>[ ] Implement cloud database (PostgreSQL/MongoDB)</li>
<li>[ ] Add email notifications for at-risk students</li>
<li>[ ] Generate PDF reports</li>
<li>[ ] Add more visualization options (pie charts, trend lines)</li>
<li>[ ] Mobile-responsive design improvements</li>
</ul>

<hr>

<h2>11. CONCLUSION</h2>
<p>The Student Performance Prediction System (SPPS) successfully demonstrates a full-stack web application with AI-powered prediction capabilities. The system allows educators to efficiently manage student records and identify at-risk students early in the academic semester.</p>
